  )
  (text "OUTPUT  7-way terminal to the NC7FD-LX on the PSU panel: 1 earth, 2-3 +V, 4-5 0 V, 6-7 -V (0 V not earthed here)"
    (at 213.36 99.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left))
    (uuid 2886ef1b-e8a7-5fe5-aa01-3b3f584f88ed)
  )
  (text "+V = 17.0 V @ (, 3.31, 4.54) A (min, typ, max); 4.54 A is the accepted worst corner; design 4 A per rail."
    (at 213.36 49.276 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 73ac8ca3-9b43-50bb-b8a2-80aebb8af23b)
  )
  (text "0V: the NEG regulator's output, 17.0 V above -V.   -V = -17.0 V @ (, 2.79, ) A (min, typ, max); design 4 A."
    (at 218.44 193.548 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 30cb2423-2ead-569e-9932-4e031e81c188)
  )
  (text "J3: to the NC7FD-LX (female) on the PSU panel, each rail on two contacts; cable NC7MX - NC7FX,"
    (at 213.36 143.307 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 4ae767ff-334e-5f9a-a1d8-15b0a5c7c36e)
  )
  (text "   7 x 1.0 mm2, <= 2 m." (at 213.36 145.847 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 8074b3db-e2e5-5f38-9f21-52e148195d5c)
  )
  (text "0V is not earthed in the PSU: it meets mains earth only at the console's star point."
    (at 213.36 148.387 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
    (uuid 6de4109e-c3cf-527f-82da-ca92b567cd01)
  )
  (text "J4: to the earth stud on the case, where the LRS-150 FG terminals go too; J3 pin 1 takes earth to the console."
